  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://schulzoli.github.io/BC-Atlas/ontology#Relation">
    <rdfs:label>Relation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>One relation found in the source, with its kind, confidence, and location (a qualified form of the direct relation property).</rdfs:comment>
